OL,3,CFinal day of Fleadh in Belfast
OL,5,FThe final day of Fleadh Cheoil na
OL,6,FhEireann is underway in Belfast.
OL,8,FMore than a million people are
OL,9,Festimated to have attended this year's
OL,10,Fevent, the first hosted by the
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland capital.
OL,13,FSunday will see the conclusion of All-
OL,14,FIreland competitions with 5,000
OL,15,Fmusicians and dancers from 22
OL,16,Fcountries taking part in 180
OL,17,Fcategories.
OL,19,FThey will end with the Senior Ceili
OL,20,FBands competition at the ICC/Belfast
OL,21,FWaterfront Hall.
