OL,3,CFinal day of Fleadh in Belfast
OL,5,FThe winning senior Ceili band will
OL,6,Ftake to the Gig Rig for a finale
OL,7,Fperformance.
OL,9,FStreet performances across the city
OL,10,Fcentre and Fleadh Fringe events on the
OL,11,Foutskirts will continue through the
OL,12,Ffinal day.
OL,14,FThe week-long event has also featured
OL,15,Fbands from the Loyalist and Unionist
OL,16,Ftraditions in Northern Ireland as well
OL,17,Fas minority ethnic communities.
