OL,3,CFinal day of Fleadh in Belfast
OL,5,FThe Secretary of State for Northern
OL,6,FIreland said Fleadh 2027 will be an
OL,7,F"even bigger success" when it returns
OL,8,Fto Belfast.
OL,10,FSir Chris Bryant congratulated
OL,11,Forganisers on social media on Sunday
OL,12,Fmorning.
OL,14,F"Many congratulations to everyone
OL,15,Finvolved in the Fleadh's first showing
OL,16,Fin Belfast which has defied
OL,17,Fexpectations showcasing an amazingly
OL,18,Ftalented and welcoming city," he said.
